    "summary": "Helen Brown (Ng\u0101i Tahu) is a senior researcher in the Ng\u0101i Tahu Archive Team at Te R\u016bnanga o Ng\u0101i Tahu. Helen has extensive experience in the Galleries, Libraries, Archives and Museums (GLAM) sector. Helen leads the award-winning T\u0101ngata Ng\u0101i Tahu biographies project that explores tribal history through the lens of biography. Volume one of T\u0101ngata Ng\u0101i Tahu: People of Ng\u0101i Tahu (with Takerei Norton, Bridget Williams Books) was winner of the 2018 New Zealand Heritage Nonfiction Book Award.",
